Regression Analysis
The multiple regression model evaluates the relationship between estimated annual
revenue and five explanatory variables: nightly price, bedrooms, guest capacity (accommodates),
review score, and Superhost status. The presentation reports that the model explains
approximately 33.2% of the variation in estimated annual revenue. This indicates that the
selected variables provide meaningful information about revenue differences, while also showing
that most of the variation is not explained by this model.
